{"id":"ee7d86f9583b7de8","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-dense.md","title":"偏序的稠密性","display":"df-dense — 偏序的稠密性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-dense","aliases":["20-df-dense"],"display":"df-dense — 偏序的稠密性","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"偏序结构的本地定义","source_pdf_pages":[175],"source_printed_pages":[141],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-dense"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-dense</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dense — 偏序的稠密性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"偏序结构的本地定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_P\">\\(\\le_P\\)</span> 为偏序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_P\">\\(&lt;_P\\)</span> 是其严格部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DenseOrder}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ [a&lt;_Pb\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\ (a&lt;_Pc&lt;_Pb)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DenseOrder}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ [a&lt;_Pb\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\ (a&lt;_Pc&lt;_Pb)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a&lt;_Pb\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\le_Pb\\land a\\ne b\\quad(a,b\\in P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a&lt;_Pb\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\le_Pb\\land a\\ne b\\quad(a,b\\in P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是序稠密性。Cohen 条件中的稠密子集表示每个条件有一个在该子集中的延伸，是另一个带参数的谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：偏序结构的本地定义；印刷页 141；PDF 第 175 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_P","display":false},{"tex":"<_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DenseOrder}(P,\\le_P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in P\\ [a<_Pb\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\ (a<_Pc<_Pb)].","display":true},{"tex":"a<_Pb\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\le_Pb\\land a\\ne b\\quad(a,b\\in P).","display":true}],"bytes":1019,"backlinks":[{"id":"21f5ed9f94a46a9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-dense]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense]] — 章 6；直接提供者 0 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense]]"}],"outgoing":[]}